# Large/local/generated datasets should never be committed.
**/data/raw/
**/data/staging/
**/data/intermediate/
**/data/processed/
**/data/curated/
**/data/quarantine/
**/data/checkpoints/
**/data/benchmark/
**/data/benchmarks/
**/data/scratch/
**/data/temp/
**/data/tmp/

# Explicit sample datasets are allowed.
!**/data/sample/
!**/data/sample/**


